From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UnlimitedBytes <admin@unlimitedbytes.ovh>
Date: Fri, 2 Jan 2026 00:04:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix race conditions from comprehensive audit

- ChunkEntitySlices: Change entitiesByClass/entitiesByType to ConcurrentHashMap with thread-safe iteration
- PlayerList: Change playersByUUID/playersByName to ConcurrentHashMap
- Entity: Make vehicle volatile, change tags to ConcurrentHashMap.newKeySet()
- ConfettiRegionLocker: Make onUnlock synchronized to prevent tailUnlockFuture race
- PlayerAdvancements: Already fixed criterionData with ConcurrentHashMap
- SimpleCriterionTrigger: Already fixed players with ConcurrentHashMap

